			"Message": "feat(Project): Add debug session tracking, custom editor save events, and .gitignore-aware search\n\nSubmodule synchronization bringing three major features and bug fixes:\n\n1. Debug Session Tracking (Mountain + Common + Sky):\n   - Mountain implements DebugSessionEntry and DebugSessions map for lifecycle management\n   - StartDebugging spawns DAP adapters with stdin/stdout/stderr pipes and parses DAP frames\n   - Messages emitted on `sky://debug/dap-message` and forwarded to DOM events\n   - StopDebugging sends DAP disconnect and unregisters the session\n   - Common adds DebugDapMessage IPC event to support this flow\n\n2. Custom Editor Save Events (Common + Mountain + Sky):\n   - Common adds CustomEditorSaved IPC event for UI notifications\n   - Mountain implements OnSaveCustomDocument to reverse-RPC to Cocoon extension sidecar\n   - Sky adds handler for `sky://customEditor/saved` dispatching cel:customEditor:saved\n\n3. Search Service Replacement (Output + Mountain):\n   - Add ReplaceSearchService transform replacing web-worker RemoteSearchService\n   - Delegates to Mountain's `search:findFiles` / `search:findInFiles` handlers\n   - Makes search .gitignore-aware via Rust's ignore::WalkBuilder\n   - Fixes search panel showing 0 matches and node_modules appearing in results\n\n4. Bug Fixes (Mountain):\n   - Fix char-aware UTF-8 truncation in WindServiceHandlers and OutputChannelAppend\n   - Avoids panics when slicing multi-byte codepoints (e.g., `•` in SCM progress)\n\nImpact: Debugging now works with real DAP adapters, custom editor save callbacks notify observers, file search respects .gitignore rules, and UTF-8 truncation no longer panics on multi-byte characters.",
			"SHA": "84ac0fa57b583db758d41a5e7ce0a7cf8f468e21"
